{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3d281cf0c6e44b38a7c12a5423de0b76ca6e94a76a2654c8a14333dd5f30e3c7", "ja": "天使たちのおやつ", "zh": "天使们的点心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9bc8f4d1f136d139c72177427603e497a0df301e0c97f1967f12a2945b1da8bf", "ja": "本番を前にして、素晴らしいパフォーマンス\nを見せるANGEL STARS。レッスン\nの合間に、カフェにケーキを食べに行き、英\n気を養う。今こそ飛び立たんとする天使たち\nが目指すのは、最高のステージ！", "zh": "在正式演出前夕，『ANGEL STARS』\n已有足够实力能展现精彩表演。在训练课程\n之间的空档，成员们来到咖啡厅享用蛋糕，\n养精蓄锐。此刻，天使们正准备展翅高飞，\n她们的目标就是最完美的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "168b2a57020a9009266a1f98b3b20869265911251213317891060ea33423671c", "ja": "（Angelの公演当日まで、あと少し。\n選抜メンバーのみでのリハーサルは……）", "zh": "（到Angel公演当天还剩一点时间。\n而在只有选拔成员的排练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1f567ab9a6b3fd20bf81700452dd7981c900cf8455fac1f168addf798dcdcefa", "ja": "（なんと、歌もダンスも一発OK！\nレッスンの成果が、確実に出てきているぞ……！）", "zh": "（居然从歌曲到舞步都一次OK！\n训练课程的结果确实展现出来了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0630e72dec3bb4f3a6ee1b03337b7568d268be5d364c906b00f91fe8162481af", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今の、かなりイイ感じじゃなかったですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n刚刚的感觉是不是还不错呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "57ea1cd7299fbc28f27775c4173bcd7575ec90a33a6e6d3319701dec600522d1", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったな！　初回でここまで\nしっかり合わせられるとは、正直言って驚いたよ。", "zh": "是啊，很完美呢！居然第一次就能\n配合得这么好，老实说吓到我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "29cb6e410920b19e68a3127b2939b95253be34748279554f459356fbb09e2485", "ja": "やりましたー！", "zh": "做到了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "2bd79d91267c5df87c513ce00f4bbca33ae3858629180ca123d75d7d2d241e24", "ja": "やった、ね……！", "zh": "成功了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "61f5877866e5163100c6e78fa9f1cb54565730115aa85769abb877ed77ada73a", "ja": "みんなの息が、ぴったり合っていましたね。\n今の感じを、忘れないようにしないと……。", "zh": "大家的默契非常完美呢，\n不可以忘记刚刚的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "792cf7fef28beb0f7e19d48d3483bef6006a2eb37b77925bbd2e0e1f48a586bf", "ja": "はい♪　とっても楽しかったですね！\nいい感じです♪", "zh": "对啊♪刚刚很开心对吧！\n感觉真棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8981bcac102fd16d4bb8c322e43d4a6288ca46f904ecbe831bc696b1a63b1460", "ja": "もちろん課題はあるけど、ひとまず良い仕上がりだ。\nこの調子で完成度を高めていこう！", "zh": "虽然还有要改进的地方，但现阶段已经很不错了。\n就这样继续提高完成度吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
