{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2d0ef2b0ec39b5e0675d122e7ee540a8eb313090f4abb3a13da4b2b7bd57cffd", "ja": "えへへ、本番楽しみだね～。\nあ～、早く公演の日にならないかな～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，真期待正式演出～\n啊～公演的日子能不能快点来啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "394be3c072487a290ed144a20b289600a465953c1f22a3c162f120b1c1064076", "ja": "はい！　わたしも、早く\nファンのみなさんに会いたいです！", "zh": "对呀！\n我也想快点见到粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f01b905e5667356ad1172ee9fc3bf1f6059e8ec143e5d82e7fc1cf62fb691428", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん。\nこの後って、わたし達、取材が入ってるんですよね？", "zh": "话说，{$P$}先生。\n我们之后要接受采访对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "05c629c3885c425b9cc7a265290e2972f1749659395f2458387ab36aeac6769d", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n夕方だから、まだ時間があるけど……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n因为是约傍晚，还有一点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1b3806de1a6b7f80bb168e9bd2b87b07642907ff0adeda217ee7cefa315b1798", "ja": "だったら、今からみんなで、\nおいしいもの食べにいきませんか？", "zh": "那我们大家要不要\n现在一起去吃点好吃的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cdffa8b91e7fd78f613cdd63c822429ff3cd83c46b2305002112a0d7f10fff95", "ja": "おいしいモノ？", "zh": "好吃的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "af6a3f423fd86f3776af5679f41ddc43c67cd72fb1849170166a13a12bee0bd6", "ja": "駅前に、オシャレなカフェができたんですよ～。\nみんなで、行ってみたいな～って……ダメ？", "zh": "车站前开了一间时髦的咖啡厅～\n真想和大家一起去看看耶……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "63dbc63370a2a5df5948c7db2b0ed5ad503a92d053c8c2f96d197b6a60beeb9f", "ja": "そうだな……\nよし、みんなで行ってみようか。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n好，大家一起去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "11f65e77d32a352ea1f760a696cc633f93fcf2f60378bab63235adedee57b955", "ja": "えっ！？　いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦！？可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "63949dd44f6dfc5e18a5db0fe4acdadbb3db50a430fd1a9c210a324b35709f0e", "ja": "今日はちゃんと成果を出せたしな、たまにはいいよ。\nみんなで行こう。", "zh": "因为今天展现出成果了嘛，偶尔放松一下也好。\n大家就一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b3875ceae4cf36e85af1074de91a50355d43416f6d047721c03f4a317a096cd", "ja": "わ～～～～い♪　{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございま～す！　大好き！", "zh": "哇～～～～♪{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你～！最喜欢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "4b55e4008fea2e22c67579fe605d7e0af377c6e7af5bf2c64d378bb03934f6a6", "ja": "あら、ここは……\n手作りケーキで有名なお店ですね！", "zh": "哎呀，这家店……\n手工蛋糕很有名呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f8cfc2c2dbc08a76247a1a42ff19d96f1bc7f74e410fbbf34a53eb09343696ee", "ja": "歌織さんもご存じなんですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐也知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "342ac76fa7a896099efd25a3b9244a6ada3b1b07276fa9d3354f150069c96e55", "ja": "はい♪　雑誌で見かけて、気になっていて……あっ。\nはしゃいだりして、子どもっぽいかしら……？", "zh": "是的♪之前在杂志上看到，就很在意……啊。\n我这么兴奋，会不会很孩子气……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "ad539dd46fc3604ea3e7f04d2fc04203c3c5d26100faddf930cb82d61c0f6e78", "ja": "わー、どれもおいしそうですね！\nじゃあ私、いつものにします♪", "zh": "哇──每个看起来都好好吃喔！\n那我就点老样子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "0900ca1ed962612bd6dd49475fff2b6ddcfd9dc497a6a7e6b9e0c9d30fc44d92", "ja": "麗花、常連なのか？", "zh": "丽花，你是常客吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "dfe354af6c952ec2aedda2ec3c66394e16c23ec0c2e59c58995ee4d7f98deabb", "ja": "いいえ、初めてですよ？\n迷った時は、いつもので！", "zh": "不是，我第一次来～\n不知道要点什么时就该说老样子嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "47c4d90bbba08e7686cafcd8a66800d80c0adc39fda5f2d2086d694366393052", "ja": "……おススメ、の方がいいかもな。すみません、\nケーキセット5つ。みんな、好きなのを選ぼう。", "zh": "……说「推荐的」可能比较好吧。不好意思，\n我要点五份蛋糕套餐。大家选自己喜欢的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "975257edab1fdaabae228d52f6ce7586d0ed547bf48778151fa0e1056e21b43f", "ja": "このショートケーキ、すごくおいしいです！\n生クリームが甘さ控えめで……♪", "zh": "这个草莓蛋糕好好吃！\n鲜奶油不会太甜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bfcb73dfbb8a94ce2ae46903b27dedefa5968cac0e5b4143b5834e93732a428c", "ja": "ん～！　パンケーキもおいし～い！　ふわふわで、\n生クリームもフルーツもいっぱいだよ～♪", "zh": "嗯～！松饼也好好吃～！软绵绵的，\n还加了满满的鲜奶油和水果～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "33a5a9ac159c9ba4bad795f635dc24518f0d63b41dafb18999355020ca6f198f", "ja": "ん……杏奈の、イチゴタルトも……おいしい……。\n星梨花ちゃん……ひと口、食べる……？", "zh": "嗯……杏奈的草莓塔……也很好吃……\n星梨花……要不要吃一口……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "f7597566756dd50d3cbe4cebb06c9140decebd6254c456161d4efd0f6b632905", "ja": "いいんですか！？　えへへ……\nじゃあ杏奈ちゃん、こっちのケーキもどうぞ♪", "zh": "可以吗！？嘿嘿……\n那小杏也吃看看我的蛋糕吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b47808316bf432d77bcaea47aec46bda2ef9893906c7e009898d5c07c5142883", "ja": "わたし、もう1個食べたいかも！\n追加しちゃおうかな～？", "zh": "我想再吃一个耶！\n要不要再加点啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_1038", "source_sha256": "9a4638d761fb0b88ecd6f52e12b6ff0669f8817add0da2eb0bd9123a6b7a81a4", "ja": "食べ過ぎはよくない", "zh": "吃太多不好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ad6ce985bca540f044bca9481cd37acfd7086c68819505654b01e010f44e4b45", "ja": "こらこら、翼、食べ過ぎは……。", "zh": "喂喂，翼，吃太多不……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "164e9e8cc759ac7a161dc56c97850e0b65d1bd120c4f0722943fe709705ecdff", "ja": "でもやっぱり、今日はやめておこっと！\n取材もありますしね～。", "zh": "但今天还是先算了吧！\n等等也还有采访～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2002_p", "source_sha256": "360f40649d7f3c9b02159bdd4762db06669bada261332d4a57532bf4f276b764", "ja": "……そうだな。うん、その方がいいと思う。", "zh": "……是啊，嗯，我想这样比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2003_048rei", "source_sha256": "779e45c00a2dc4ddae2f56909bd15e1c7a8d085789e712896b5d11e438a2cae2", "ja": "歌織さん、このアップルパイ、\nとっても美味しいからひと口あげるね？　あーん♪", "zh": "歌织，这个苹果派好好吃，\n分你一口喔～啊──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2004_052kao", "source_sha256": "a38e11cd255da85ffb6fb38fa189638eae7f7e2a425769256ccbacc5f6f075c6", "ja": "麗花ちゃん……そんな、あーんだなんて……。\nあ、あ～ん……？", "zh": "丽花……居然叫我「啊──」……\n啊、啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2005_p", "source_sha256": "37628a5080f6b6ffe5f49452feea84e4e67487ef0fd51a9af9d36841341d9119", "ja": "（みんな、思い思いに楽しんでるな。\nいい息抜きができてよかった）", "zh": "（大家都乐在其中呢，\n能好好喘口气真是太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2006_p", "source_sha256": "103bb639cc080c22bade31312629589908b9650abecbc55e561d80b3d41f0eac", "ja": "（もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろみんなに、声を掛けて……）", "zh": "（已经这时候了啊，\n差不多该叫大家……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2007_052kao", "source_sha256": "30cb1ab8a52d71fa440d6760fbd4f35f48a9ee7c545a9f369788a2e642570de6", "ja": "あら……もうこんな時間！\nみんな、そろそろ劇場に戻りましょう？", "zh": "哎呀……已经这个时间了！\n各位，我们差不多该回剧场啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2009_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2011_024ann", "source_sha256": "059c5ca157b74d3dc1381c3605e2d380c6963c4411791c40a7cba5647fa45b3e", "ja": "はい……♪", "zh": "好的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0c2eed33b4ebdd0a4141847bf18fc57edd8e567f0b0d07ed02ba41fd6359e7cc", "ja": "やっぱりこのお店にして正解でしたね～。\nまた食べに来たいな～♪", "zh": "选这家店果然是对的～\n好想再来吃喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e27d3a753844fc364a69cc5b507da09e5cc87be7dd8439e5afb6327798bd0097", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\nわたし達の公演でもパンケーキ振る舞いましょうよ～。", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生，\n我们也在公演中提供松饼嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2014_048rei", "source_sha256": "345e7cf5967a7566b958baf3471ee560cb5326173e17d20de1d0738f2c244ea6", "ja": "わぁ、Angelチームのパンケーキパーティー？\nみんなで幸せな気持ちになれちゃいますね♪", "zh": "哇，Angel队的松饼派对？\n这样大家就能一起感受幸福呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2015_p", "source_sha256": "cd31fbbc18c864d6e9c411808c5654390d2165f7c863d8724a2bf05d6d6327c9", "ja": "はは、面白いアイディアだけど、\n公演の1番のごちそうは、みんなのステージだ。", "zh": "哈哈，这点子很有趣，\n但公演最重要的料理是大家的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2016_p", "source_sha256": "88e9d0bdc6626232740c836aee577de3f5bbf739be4db289fa0c9f79035f1c8c", "ja": "Angelチームの歌とダンスで、パンケーキみたいに\n盛りだくさんの公演にしてくれ！", "zh": "就像层层叠起的松饼一样，用Angel队的歌舞表演\n将公演气氛推向高峰吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2017_052kao", "source_sha256": "d8148de3e4c86283bff746699c4083023063710226c0ea99de6113e858254ca2", "ja": "はいっ。私たちの、精いっぱいで……\nみなさんをおもてなしします♪", "zh": "好的，我们会尽全力……\n来招待大家的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2018_022ser", "source_sha256": "28ef86f1313d7bf94f0fd514a743507c2618eb1e168c23dc79b348c480d2c4e4", "ja": "わたしもショートケーキみたいに、\nみんなに喜んでもらえるように、がんばります♪", "zh": "我也要像草莓蛋糕一样，\n努力为大家带来喜悦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2019_024ann", "source_sha256": "5751eae036f1c9bac62a0d363a72ae2a5e913249480cca293470a374e69ef411", "ja": "杏奈も……、おススメ、できるくらい……、ね♪", "zh": "杏奈也会……努力成为推荐卖点……的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2020_p", "source_sha256": "9d8e5557f2caadb2f5390bbed2e91b27e2ded6a9104a830b365d3fb7666fea15", "ja": "（最初は、ただ飛び回ることを楽しんでいた彼女達。\nだが今は、きちんと目的地を見定めて飛んでいる）", "zh": "（她们一开始只是享受着飞翔的乐趣，\n但如今是看准了目的地坚定飞去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_05_2021_p", "source_sha256": "ae86a572bded1a27335a898eba8f01ae75f62157948316ac1662900fe7aeab73", "ja": "（みんな頼もしくなって来たな。\nみんなが飛び立つ時は……もうすぐだ！）", "zh": "（大家都渐渐变得可靠了呢。\n大家展翅高飞的时刻……就快到来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
